  "name": "Greek Penne and Chicken",
  "subtitle": "A bright pasta skillet with chicken, artichokes, feta, and lemon",
  "description": "Penne is tossed with sautéed chicken, artichokes, tomato, herbs, feta, and lemon for a quick Greek-inspired main dish.",
